+### Form control classes
+
+The text-control key ships whole: the control itself, its file button, date parts, and
+placeholder, its focus and disabled states, the plaintext form, the small and large sizes, the
+textarea heights, the color control and its swatches, and the reduced-motion twins of the control
+and file-button transitions. The component partial loads before the range partial in the
+components layer. The rules keyed to a bare element or a bare part stay in the elements layer — the
+date-field padding, the color swatch wrapper's padding, and the file button's font and appearance —
+and the `src/styles/components/_form-control.scss` partial restates none of them.
+
+The file button ships on the standard `::file-selector-button` part. The prefixed
